# === NPC 7: Keeper of Stones ===
~ start
Stones: Only the worthy may pass.
=> Q8

~ Q8
Stones: θ in 0 ≤ θ < 2π if cos(θ) = −1 is:
- A. π => Q8_CORRECT
- B. 2π => Q8_WRONG
- C. π/2 => Q8_WRONG
- D. 0 => Q8_WRONG

~ Q8_CORRECT
Stones: You understand… the stones approve.
=> END

~ Q8_WRONG
Stones: Wrong… focus and retry.
=> Q8